# The ffmpeg build used to re-encode the sound banks. Six hundred megabytes of a
# redistributable nobody needs in order to rebuild the mod; the script that uses it is
# the one file worth keeping and it is two directories down.
tools/ffmpeg/

# The arcabuz was an experiment that never became a weapon. The files stay on disk in
# case the idea comes back, but they are not part of the mod and they were sitting in
# the resources tree where the jar would have shipped them.
src/main/resources/assets/cortescombat/models/item/arcabuz.json
src/main/resources/assets/cortescombat/textures/models/arcabuz.png
src/main/resources/assets/cortescombat/textures/models/arcabuz.png.mcmeta
src/main/resources/assets/cortescombat/textures/particle/arcabuz_shot.png
